  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Put an option in the settings menu, like the vive advanced controls, to give users with index controllers an option that toggles off finger tracking, allows hand overrides, and has the emotes work like they do on oculus touch, button combinations instead of capacitive tracking. \n\nBecause let's face it, doing rock and roll and victory on index is way too difficult. And the finger curling while idly holding the controllers looks gross compared to the default hand idle pose.",
